on","rarity":1,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Texas","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Texas the Omertosa","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Thorns","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Thorns the Lodestar","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"THRM-EX","rarity":1,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Thumpy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Timeslot","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Tin Man","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Tippi","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Titi","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Toddifons","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Togawa Sakiko","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Tomimi","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Totter","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Tragodia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Tsukinogi","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Tuye","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Typhon","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"U-Official","rarity":1,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Ukusik","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Ulpianus","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Underflow","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Utage","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Valarqvin","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vanilla","rarity":3,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Varkáris","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vendela","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Verdant","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vermeil","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vetochki","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vigil","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vigna","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vina Victoria","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Violet Mizutsune Orchid","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Virtuosa","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viviana","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulcan","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulpisfoglia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"W","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Waai Fu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wakaba Mutsumi","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wang","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wanqing","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warfarin","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warmy","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Weedy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whislash","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whisperain","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wild Mane","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wind Chimes","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windflit","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windscoot","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wiš'adel","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wulfenite","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Xingzhu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yahata Umiri","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yato","rarity":2,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yu","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yūtenji Nyamu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima the Raging Tide","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zinogre S Catapult","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zuo Le","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"techniqueUnitIcons":{},"techniqueBranchOperators":{},"techniqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{},"forms":null,"skillRanges":null,"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":4,"rows":3,"opCell":[2,2],"rangeCells":[[1,1],[1,2],[1,3],[1,4],[2,1],[2,3],[2,4],[3,1],[3,2],[3,3],[3,4]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"I'll make the arrangements. Just leave it to me.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Doctor, I certainly hope my teammates won't cause any trouble while I'm here working for you... Aagh, the more I think of it the worse this headache gets...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"An ordinary job, a peaceful life. That's all I ever wanted.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"Yeah, it's not that I don't get along with the other A6 members... I just get a little headache whenever I see them...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"My group members just bump into new troubles every day. There is the anti-social one, the never listening one, the awfully stubborn one… Just when will they ever settle down and work?...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"I don't know how I ended up on this team either. All I wanted was an ordinary life. Why did I end up in charge of these... problem children?! Wait a minute, Midnight is a grown man!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"Popukar... gotta pat her on the head. Catapult... gotta tie her up. Spot... never make him mad. As for Midnight, just knock him out. There, Doctor, now you know the proper protocol for dealing with Team A6.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"I made a cake for my teammates. Wanna take a slice, Doctor? Everyone in A6 just love fruitcakes. They really are a bunch of kids, aren't they?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Not much time left. Done with your work for the day, Doctor?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"Captain of Reserve Op Team A6, Orchid, reporting in. Are you the Dr. {@nickname}? I look forward to working with you.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"I learned a lot from this video. I'll keep it in mind for sure.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Thank you so much. I'll work hard to improve my skills from now on and strive for better results for you!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"I'll complete my mission to the best of my ability.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Please follow the tactical combat manual closely, everyone. Thank you for your cooperation.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"The battle has begun! Be careful, everyone!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Please make sure you follow every detail on the plan. Alright, everyone, now spread out!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Go ahead.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Here.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Orchid, ready to move.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Just as planned.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Target locked!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Stop them now!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"Out of my way!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"Oh come on, I already have enough work to deal with!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"Well done, Doctor! Impeccable leadership even against such a tough opponent.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"A perfect job! Looks like we can have a good rest today.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"We need to work harder next time.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"Is everyone okay? Let's get out of here!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"Oh, What a noisy place...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"What do you want...?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"Huh?! Overtime again?! Ugh, I knew it...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Popukar, listen, I want you to sit still on the couch... Catapult, what are you doing—they just hung the streamers from that window! Midnight, for heaven's sakes, get down from the fireworks pile! Ugh, all of you! Stop messing around, NOW! Or nobody's getting a New Year's present! NOBODY!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Greetings, Doctor. Let's start today's work just as planned.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Present time. I picked out a color-changing lipstick, one that goes from transparent to light pink. Even if you aren't in any makeup, it'll give you some complexion. I wasn't sure what kind you'd like, so I went the one I use, a fruit flavor. How about you give it a try...? No, no, Doctor, no licking once it's on.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"I've been so busy with work, I wouldn't even have noticed another year vanish in a blink. Forget anything else, I have far more patience than I used to, honestly. Have they grown up? No, they're still the same loud brats as ever. But at least they're doing much better now. Look at this—they made me tea after hearing I had overtime.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Susie Riddell"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/58e999c42e9fb00832d571ab35a1666000557088/current/char_278_orchid/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Airi Ohtsu"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/15ab8a81f1fc3b7e9b5486cf00c5afdc4b948649/current/char_278_orchid/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Ke Zhong"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/88535cc2a7c43056f2c370850184545b8c478a43/current/char_278_orchid/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Yeo Min-jeong"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/38e75788058bbbbc5b17330a1591245fbb08f822/current/char_278_orchid/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}